# Update Protocol

When you modify code, update the matching `docs/` file (and, for `graphyn-ui/`, the matching `.kiro/steering/` file) before finishing. Change only the affected section — never rewrite whole files.

Only the two frontend steering files remain in `.kiro/steering/`; the backend steering files (`project-overview`, `node-base`, `node-registry`, `plugin-development`, `plugin-ecosystem`, `pipeline-execution`, `api-*`, `sdk-cli`, `backend-services`, `mcp-server`, `data-models`, `file-header-contracts`, `update-protocol`) were removed in commit `6f0cd7f` — `docs/` is canonical for those areas.

| Code area | Steering | Docs |
|---|---|---|
| Top-level / env / entry points | — | `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `GETTING_STARTED.md`, `DEPLOYMENT.md` (env reference) |
| Node base / ports / metadata / config | — | `PLUGIN_GUIDE.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| Registry / discovery / plugin catalog | — | `PLUGIN_GUIDE.md`, `NODE_CATALOGUE.md` |
| Plugins / PluginPackage | — | `PLUGIN_GUIDE.md`, `NODE_CATALOGUE.md` |
| Orchestrator / IR / planner / executor / validation / cache / run lifecycle | — | `PIPELINE_EXECUTION.md` |
| Distributed backend / workers / queue | — | `DISTRIBUTED_EXECUTION.md` |
| API routers / `api/main.py` | — | `API_REFERENCE.md` |
| SDK / CLI | — | `SDK_AND_CLI.md`, `GETTING_STARTED.md` |
| Runs / artifacts / workspace / domain | — | `DATA_FLOW_AND_WORKSPACE.md`, `PIPELINE_EXECUTION.md` |
| MCP | — | `MCP_SERVER.md`, `MCP_AGENT_PACK_COVERAGE.md` |
| Secrets / credentials / auth / egress | — | `TRUST_MODEL.md`, `ops/CREDENTIAL_STORE.md` |
| graphyn-ui canvas / shell | `frontend-canvas.md` | — |
| graphyn-ui feature screens | `frontend-features.md` | — |

**Issues:** new → add to `KNOWN_ISSUES.md`. Fixed → remove from open tiers.
